{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEMO DESCRIPTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is the demo of FEED MY MECH, what is here is a polished core gameplay loop that represents (to a point) the final product. This is just a taste content wise, with only the first area being available to play. Playtime will vary greatly for the first area as is , it is intended to be a trail and error ground to get accustomed to the basic mechanics of the game. I hope you enjoy playing this demo as I have put a lot of effort into it!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951760/extras/e4de33a345079d56dfccbfc56348033a.poster.avif?t=1757372621\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951760/extras/e4de33a345079d56dfccbfc56348033a.webm?t=1757372621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951760/extras/e4de33a345079d56dfccbfc56348033a.mp4?t=1757372621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Here is the description for the <strong>FULL GAME</strong>:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mech is all that stands between you and what writhes below. <strong>FEED MY MECH</strong> is a short horror experience\u2014venture into a dead underground colony and recover lost tech. But something is spreading through the machines\u2026 and it\u2019s looking for a way inside your mech.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Immersive Kind of Horror:</strong>\u00a0You are trapped inside of a mechanical chassis, you can't move, you can't hide, you can't run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited Vision:</strong>\u00a0There are no windows to look beyond the cold metal walls of your mech. Make use of distorted, unreliable screens and maps to navigate the decaying environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong>\u00a0Explore the remains on what could have been a prospering community and discover secrets that may hint to what went wrong.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Short Horror Experience:</strong> Can be completed in only an hour and a half on the main path, but explore more if you wish, there are many secrets to find beyond that...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951760/extras/353b527d82bb84d263d741fe61a8a872.poster.avif?t=1757372621\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951760/extras/353b527d82bb84d263d741fe61a8a872.webm?t=1757372621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951760/extras/353b527d82bb84d263d741fe61a8a872.mp4?t=1757372621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLOT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main portion of the gameplay is set within a mech provided by your employer, <i>Solance Systems</i>. They have tasked you with retrieving &quot;Signals&quot; from various remains of previous mech pilots in the area, any further information about your task is <strong>strictly confidential</strong>. Something goes wrong while you're down there, you are trapped in an old residential colony below your target location. While not intended, Solance tasks you with collecting the &quot;Signals&quot; on this lower, more hostile floor. <strong>They aren't carving an escape path for you until you do.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951760/extras/6c58f0536623a9502a2a6294e0b7bc54.poster.avif?t=1757372621\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951760/extras/6c58f0536623a9502a2a6294e0b7bc54.webm?t=1757372621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951760/extras/6c58f0536623a9502a2a6294e0b7bc54.mp4?t=1757372621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Get the signals, get out, and maybe discover what <strong>actually</strong> happened to this residential colony on the way...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"THE DESCENT BEGINS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3951760/6b9f67bcb9573a905de6bf264b4a1a6c9c26cd36.jpg"},{"name":"CONFIGURATION","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3951760/fd9d6873859591c609a30af20a5d2217b100e54c.jpg"},{"name":"JUMPSCARED","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3951760/39d30eade481a8509ce9a9cc0b4f0fe0a5f5e980.jpg"},{"name":"HUNT THEM DOWN","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3951760/60dbf412726dc7fb3fdb190c9bfabe85a37bfa78.jpg"},{"name":"THE HUNGER BEGINS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3951760/e8834c9c07416599a934d87fabb48f572bfbcb5c.jpg"},{"name":"FIRST SIGNAL","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3951760/2dc35833d462da1160a3723ea523093dd85a5ecc.jpg"},{"name":"LET THERE BE LIGHT","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3951760/1b50d5e54fe31ac467a515a09815ffc0b29e0980.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3951760?t=1757372621","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3951760?t=1757372621","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951760/94d85592923b5d9442c813b3a0aba8a30d7eec06/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757372621","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951760/94d85592923b5d9442c813b3a0aba8a30d7eec06/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757372621","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEMO DESCRIPTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is the demo of FEED MY MECH, what is here is a polished core gameplay loop that represents (to a point) the final product. This is just a taste content wise, with only the first area being available to play. Playtime will vary greatly for the first area as is , it is intended to be a trail and error ground to get accustomed to the basic mechanics of the game. I hope you enjoy playing this demo as I have put a lot of effort into it!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951760/extras/e4de33a345079d56dfccbfc56348033a.poster.avif?t=1757372621\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951760/extras/e4de33a345079d56dfccbfc56348033a.webm?t=1757372621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951760/extras/e4de33a345079d56dfccbfc56348033a.mp4?t=1757372621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Here is the description for the <strong>FULL GAME</strong>:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mech is all that stands between you and what writhes below. <strong>FEED MY MECH</strong> is a short horror experience\u2014venture into a dead underground colony and recover lost tech. But something is spreading through the machines\u2026 and it\u2019s looking for a way inside your mech.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Immersive Kind of Horror:</strong>\u00a0You are trapped inside of a mechanical chassis, you can't move, you can't hide, you can't run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited Vision:</strong>\u00a0There are no windows to look beyond the cold metal walls of your mech. Make use of distorted, unreliable screens and maps to navigate the decaying environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong>\u00a0Explore the remains on what could have been a prospering community and discover secrets that may hint to what went wrong.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Short Horror Experience:</strong> Can be completed in only an hour and a half on the main path, but explore more if you wish, there are many secrets to find beyond that...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951760/extras/353b527d82bb84d263d741fe61a8a872.poster.avif?t=1757372621\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951760/extras/353b527d82bb84d263d741fe61a8a872.webm?t=1757372621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951760/extras/353b527d82bb84d263d741fe61a8a872.mp4?t=1757372621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLOT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main portion of the gameplay is set within a mech provided by your employer, <i>Solance Systems</i>. They have tasked you with retrieving &quot;Signals&quot; from various remains of previous mech pilots in the area, any further information about your task is <strong>strictly confidential</strong>. Something goes wrong while you're down there, you are trapped in an old residential colony below your target location. While not intended, Solance tasks you with collecting the &quot;Signals&quot; on this lower, more hostile floor. <strong>They aren't carving an escape path for you until you do.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951760/extras/6c58f0536623a9502a2a6294e0b7bc54.poster.avif?t=1757372621\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951760/extras/6c58f0536623a9502a2a6294e0b7bc54.webm?t=1757372621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951760/extras/6c58f0536623a9502a2a6294e0b7bc54.mp4?t=1757372621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Get the signals, get out, and maybe discover what <strong>actually</strong> happened to this residential colony on the way...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["TheManiacMartian"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3906110","name":"FEED MY MECH"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951760/1c6d91f9ec6258ab583a1557f67afd468671bc99/header.jpg?t=1757372621","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>